{
  "title": "Wiki on Localhost",
  "story": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4f8e785f85d961a7",
      "text": "We have options for running wiki locally."
    },
    {
      "type": "reference",
      "id": "4e8e342b350efb22",
      "text": "This page is a [[How To]].",
      "site": "meta.wiki.do",
      "slug": "meta",
      "title": "Meta"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "4d8195ed6c3bc365",
      "text": "# for authors interested in writing in a local wiki\nnpm install -g wiki"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "8370012d1a6fc165",
      "text": "To run wiki as a service, see [[LaunchAgent Wiki]]."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "9fcadf5d50f3b734",
      "text": "# for developers interested in hacking wiki\ngit clone git@github.com:fedwiki/wiki.git\ncd wiki\nnpm install -g ."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b69be05cbb9e6c5c",
      "text": "[http://wiki.localhost:3000 wiki.localhost:3000]"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "3507914727ebfc00",
      "text": "# run an editable local wiki\ncd wiki\nwiki --data ./.data --security_legacy"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "25b5b41af4312f23",
      "text": "See also [[Local Kubernetes Wiki]]"
    },
    {
      "type": "pagefold",
      "id": "740eab17941a734b",
      "text": "."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "45a78db8396004ec",
      "text": "Over time I installed node in two ways: nvm and homebrew. I haven't developed a strong preference and also haven't encountered problems for having both. I do have some vague sense of comfort in having nvm around in case I need to troubleshoot code using different versions of node."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "b59d634420a1ad2c",
      "text": "See NVM installation instructions [https://github.com/nvm-sh/nvm?tab=readme-ov-file#node-version-manager--- nvm-sh/nvm]."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "781cbdb4ccb7190c",
      "text": "# a few steps for local development\n# not strictly necessary, but convenient to isolate installation to a specific version of node\nnvm install --lts\nnvm alias wikidev lts\nnvm use wikidev"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "217fbf4570749f7f",
      "text": "See homebrew installation instructions [https://brew.sh/ site]."
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "1db521da5bd2be32",
      "text": "brew install node"
    }
  ],
